#: qt/main.py:22
msgid ""
"--fetch-dependencies and --do-install were discontinued: they were internal "
"Bash helpers. Open a .flatpakref file and use Install. No operation was "
"performed."
msgstr ""
"--fetch-dependencies dan --do-install sudah dihentikan: keduanya adalah "
"pembantu Bash internal. Buka file .flatpakref dan gunakan Instal. Tidak ada "
"operasi yang dijalankan."

