msgstr ""
"--remove memerlukan file .flatpakref dan --scope user|system|system:ID; "
"identitasnya diambil dari file."

#: qt/main.py:33
msgid ""
"Provide a local .flatpakref file. Standalone IDs or URLs from the old "
